{"id":"beats-8e74b1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-878586bc-ecbd-40de-b0a0-4a4f37394600","text":"## Implementation\n\nAdded inline issue creation from the backlog status group headers.\n\n### How it works\n- Each status group header now has a `+` button on the right\n- Clicking it opens an inline input row at the top of that group\n- Type a title and press Enter to create — the issue gets the group's status\n- Esc or blur cancels\n- After creation, the input stays open for quick batch entry\n- If status isn't BACKLOG, a follow-up UPDATE draft sets the correct status\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — added inline creation state, handler, and UI"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T10:21:56.439688Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
