{"id":"beats-a3e1c7","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-60372b4b-3abd-4038-aa54-f2ba235f836a","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented sort controls and priority field for backlog ordering.\n\n### Sort controls\n- Added sort dropdown in the Backlog tab bar (Created / Updated / Priority / Title / Estimate)\n- Sort preference persists in `localStorage`\n- Issues within each status group are sorted by the active sort key\n- Sort utility in `web/src/utils/sort.ts` is shared between Backlog and App\n\n### Navigation fix\n- Issue detail prev/next now follows the Backlog's visual order instead of raw API order\n- Backlog reports its flat visible issue list to App via `onNavigationOrderChange` callback\n- Falls back to a default status-grouped sort when Backlog isn't mounted\n\n### Priority field (full stack)\n- **Go model**: Added `Priority int` to `Issue`, `CreatePayload`, `UpdatePayload` in `internal/model/types.go`\n- **Projection**: Handles priority in both CREATE and UPDATE paths\n- **API**: `IssueResponse` includes `priority` field, mapped in `issueToResponse()`\n- **TypeScript**: Added `priority: number` to Issue interface\n- **IssueDetail**: Priority property row with bar-chart icon, popover selector (None, P1-P9), keyboard shortcut `P`\n- **Backlog rows**: Shows colored `P1`-`P9` badge (red for 1-2, amber for 3-4, muted for 5+)\n- **Sort**: Priority sort puts ranked items first (ascending), unranked last\n\n### Files changed\n- `internal/model/types.go`, `internal/beats/projection.go`, `internal/server/handlers.go`\n- `web/src/utils/sort.ts` (new), `web/src/api/types.ts`\n- `web/src/App.tsx`, `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`, `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T13:10:48.292613Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
