{"id":"beats-e1ee26","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Enable drag-and-drop on the kanban board to change issue status by moving cards between columns. Also add ability to drag and drop within a column to change sort order.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Drag a card from one column to another to update its status\n- Visual feedback during drag (ghost card, drop target highlight)\n- Optimistic UI update with draft event created on drop\n- Consider using a lightweight DnD library (e.g. `@dnd-kit/core`) or native HTML drag API\n\n## Edge Cases\n\n- Dragging to the same column should be a no-op\n- Handle rapid successive drags gracefully"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T14:47:56.535388Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
