{"id":"beats-5ea4a9","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Delete issues from the web UI","description":"## Description\n\nAdd the ability to delete an issue and its history from the web UI.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Add a `DELETE /api/issues/{id}` endpoint to the backend server that calls the existing `beats delete` logic\n- Add a delete button/action to the issue detail view in the web UI (e.g. in the sidebar or header)\n- Show a confirmation dialog before deleting\n- After deletion, navigate back to the issue list and refresh\n- Support an optional reason for deletion (matching the CLI `--reason` flag)\n\n## Notes\n\nThe CLI already supports `beats delete \u003cid\u003e` with `--reason` and `--force` flags. The backend just needs to expose this over HTTP.","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-05-20T11:05:36.96485Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
