{"id":"beats-7b9830","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b2b082b5-2383-4b00-be57-11c1bdd2cc25","text":"## Summary\n\n- Widened issue ID column from 88px to 110px to prevent truncation on longer IDs\n- Estimate column now has fixed width (`w-10`), right-aligned, with a triangle icon in front of the number\n- Date column widened from `w-12` to `w-16` for better readability, right-aligned\n- Both estimate and date columns always occupy their space (empty when no value), keeping rows aligned\n\nAlso fixed a critical performance bug: an infinite re-render loop in `Backlog.tsx` where `onNavigationOrderChange` was triggering parent state updates on every render, causing 120% CPU usage. Added dedup check so it only fires when the order actually changes."},"created_at":"2026-05-20T12:22:55.46492Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
