{"id":"beats-efc206","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-bd0930be-29b3-42c4-92c1-cee2bc82fdd1","text":"## Changes\n\nConverted the New Issue modal label picker from single-select to multi-select:\n\n- State changed from single `label` string to `labels` string array, defaulting to `['feature']`\n- `selectLabel()` replaced with `toggleLabel()`: clicking a label toggles it on/off, minimum one required\n- Label dropdown stays open after toggling for easy multi-pick\n- Button displays all selected labels as LabelBadge components\n- Checkmarks shown for all selected labels in the dropdown\n- `createIssue()` sends the full labels array\n- Create button disabled when no labels selected"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T06:47:08.505231Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
